      "created_at": "2019-03-20T21:37:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,<br>\nI encountered what I think is a bug. I tried to play Grasping Shadow-Cloth and target OblivAeon's trash. He had ~8 cards in the trash at the time, but a message popped up saying that the trash was empty. OblivAeon was in the other Battlezone, so I thought it could have been that so I rewound and chose the Scion deck, as it had ~15 cards and a Scion was active in both zones. However, I got the message saying that the scion trash was empty as well.<br>\n<br>\nAs per my understanding of the rules, I should have been able to target the Scion deck/trash as there was a scion in the same battlezone. Is this not the case?&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n~Komori</p>",
